<h3>Activity1: three ORIGINAL blank-number carnival stories</h3>
<ol><li>Clare waits for Tyler's Ferris wheel ride: choose realistic departure and return times; calculate waiting interval.</li><li>Roller coaster line: choose number of minutes waited and ride starting time; find when they joined queue.</li><li>Arrival at carnival: choose start time and elapsed minutes until lemonade; calculate break time.</li></ol>
<p>Groups of THREE each choose one scenario first, then collaborate to solve ALL THREE. Many valid times are allowed; teacher checks chronological coherence and explanation.</p>
<h3>Activity2: Lemonade Break — ask a QUESTION matching original work</h3>
<p>132 L made, 90 L left at visit, 56 L left by end of day; sell remaining in4-liter jugs.</p>
